<title>USA: Central Sprinkler Corp Q4 net drops.</title>
<headline>Central Sprinkler Corp Q4 net drops.</headline>
<dateline>LANSDALE, Pa. 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Amounts in thousands, except per share)</p>
<p>				     Three Months	   Year</p>
<p>				 Ended October 31,  Ended October 31,</p>
<p>			     1996	   1995	1996	 1995</p>
<p> Net Sales	     $52,178     $44,387  $187,220   $158,849</p>
<p> Operating Income	1,170	 4,652     8,999     15,305</p>
<p> Net Income		  153	 2,698     3,763	8,458</p>
<p>Average Number of Shares</p>
<p>			     3,283	 3,307     3,330	3,382</p>
<p> Earnings per Share	.05	   .82	1.13	 2.50</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 and year 1996 net includes $3.8 million pre-tax charge related to testing program for products possibly exposed to harmful substances during installation.</p>
<p>Charge reduces Q4 EPS by $0.72.</p>
</text>
